# How to Delete Your Account and Data in TotalMen

Welcome to **TotalMen** by TotalMen Developers.

If you wish to delete your account and associated data from the TotalMen app, please follow the steps below:

## Steps to Delete Your Account

1. **Open the TotalMen app** on your device.
2. Go to the **Account** section.
3. Click on the **Log Out** button.
4. Select **Delete Account** from the options provided.
5. Follow the on-screen prompts to confirm your account deletion request.

## What Happens When You Delete Your Account

- **All personal data** associated with your account (including your profile, goals, and community activity) will be permanently deleted from our servers.
- **Your email and login credentials** will be removed and cannot be recovered.
- **Any purchase history** or subscription information will be deleted, except where required for legal or financial record-keeping.

## Data Retention

- Some data may be retained for a limited period if required by law (e.g., for tax or fraud prevention purposes). This data will be securely deleted after the mandatory retention period.
- Non-personal, aggregated, or anonymized data may be kept for analytics and service improvement, but it will not be linked to your identity.

If you have any questions or need further assistance, please contact us at [support@totalmen.app](mailto:support@totalmen.app).

